n film con Bruce Willis. L'attore, che si è fatto crescere una fluente barba che lo rende irriconoscibile, non ha la benché minima intenzione di tagliarsela."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"During the course of an ordinary week in Hollywood, movie producer Ben must navigate his way through shark-infested waters as he struggles to complete his latest projects. A demanding studio boss demands extensive changes to a movie starring Sean Penn, while another chief won't greenlight a project unless star Bruce Willis shaves his beard. Meanwhile, Ben tries to reconcile with his wife and maintain a relationship with his young daughter.","tagline":"Admit nothing."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7CMR0hVhvF2diXL78HRfJfT6Ju.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7CMR0hVhvF2diXL78HRfJfT6Ju.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1143},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bzCdyFGeg199yB9uRrbgDM2npqU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bzCdyFGeg199yB9uRrbgDM2npqU.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1199},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o88aPDDMtdwQsPyXqSKhu98jjru.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o88aPDDMtdwQsPyXqSKhu98jjru.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ibJ06Rolj3LSbbSJW3FsuDb1UQy.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ibJ06Rolj3LSbbSJW3FsuDb1UQy.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/327kOx98VB2uA3FZL9LkiXWshIm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/327kOx98VB2uA3FZL9LkiXWshIm.jpg","language":"en","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/N2bzzXHekm1WXPdNFLRUdTVCmi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/N2bzzXHekm1WXPdNFLRUdTVCmi.jpg","language":"en","width":1987,"height":2980},{"type":"poster